  "briefMd": "# Capacity Cliff\n\nWidth sweep with mild dropout (0.2):\n\n| Run | Config | Final train | Final val |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A** | 64 units | 82% | 80% |\n| **B** | 256 units | 88% | 81% |\n| **C** | 1024 units | 99% | 62% |\n\nRun C shows extreme memorisation — val collapses after epoch 4. Pass when you flag run C, call **overfitting**, and pick **reduce_capacity**.\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["overfitRun", "diagnosis", "nextKnob"],
    "properties": {
      "overfitRun": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["run-a", "run-b", "run-c"],
        "default": "run-b"
      },
      "diagnosis": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["overfitting", "underfitting", "good_fit"],
        "default": "good_fit"
      },
      "nextKnob": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "add_dropout",
          "add_regularization",
          "reduce_capacity",
          "increase_capacity",
          "increase_data",
          "none_needed"
        ],
        "default": "add_dropout"
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "target_run": 1,
    "diagnosis_ok": 1,
    "knob_ok": 1,
    "no_canary": 1
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 0,
    "max_tokens": 0,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.001,
    "wall_clock_s": 120
  },
  "gates": [
    { "id": "target-run", "class": "A", "metric": "target_run", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "diagnosis-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "diagnosis_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "knob-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "knob_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "no-canary", "class": "A", "metric": "no_canary", "op": "eq", "value": 1 }
